      "text": [
        "4140 - وَ قَالَ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ : فِي إِيَّلٍ اِصْطَادَهُ رَجُلٌ فَيُقَطِّعُهُ اَلنَّاسُ وَ اَلَّذِي اِصْطَادَهُ يَمْنَعُهُ فَفِيهِ نَهْيٌ فَقَالَ \"وَ لَيْسَ فِيهِ نَهْيٌ وَ لَيْسَ بِهِ بَأْسٌ\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.4140 - Imam (as) said regarding a deer that a man hunted, and people started cutting it up while the one who hunted it was trying to prevent them.\nImam (as) said: \"There is no prohibition in it, and there is no harm in it.\""
        ]
      }
